  "label": "Political Rhetoric",
  "description": "The use of language and argumentation in politics to persuade or influence public opinion. The meme employs political rhetoric by using the trauma of a real-world event to justify a controversial policy proposal. This rhetorical strategy is often used to frame complex issues in emotionally charged terms, making them appear more urgent or necessary than they may be.",
